<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 24, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 24, background: '#7C3AED', borderRadius: 4 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>AI 产品经理实战训练营 · W1D2</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', right: 60, bottom: 34 }}>11 / 16</Text>
    <Box style={{ gap: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>第三阶段：RLHF = 满意度回访</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 24px', alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>满意度回访：同一个问题出多个回答，让人来排序</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1.5px solid #16A34A', borderRadius: 14, padding: '22px 26px', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#16A34A', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16A34A' }}>有用的回答</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1E1B4B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>直接给方案、给步骤，<br />站在提问者的场景里解决问题</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1.5px solid #CBD5E1', borderRadius: 14, padding: '22px 26px', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#94A3B8', borderRadius: 6, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B' }}>正确的废话</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>每句都对但没有用，<br />「建议根据实际情况综合考虑」</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E1B4B' }}>千万次排序之后，模型的「脾气」被塑造成型——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>这是对齐的产物，不是天生的</span></Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
